      "cooked": "<p>The death of Sk8blayd</p>\n<aside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\" data-onebox-src=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/episode-261-rook-city-renegades-100\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n\n      <a href=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/episode-261-rook-city-renegades-100\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">theletterspage.libsyn.com</a>\n  </header>\n\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/9/9a9dbe46c644d40585f2b2c15b4093a02ea2bdf1.png\" class=\"thumbnail onebox-avatar\" width=\"250\" height=\"250\">\n\n<h3><a href=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/episode-261-rook-city-renegades-100\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">The Letters Page: Episode #261 - Rook City Renegades #100</a></h3>\n\n  <p>The most extreme non-extremeverse story!  Show Notes: Run Time: 1:15{6 According to Trevor, this may be our most gruesome episode since the Spite episode! Fitting. Also: sorry! This is the week of recording lots of episodes, so get your questions in...</p>\n\n\n  </article>\n\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/1/1ce67fdc5d6bb78102e6612ea6f36a19f2a7f107.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/1ce67fdc5d6bb78102e6612ea6f36a19f2a7f107\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/1/1ce67fdc5d6bb78102e6612ea6f36a19f2a7f107_2_322x500.jpeg\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"47Fd8QLV6v3HF3MRuRvnKreGxq7\" width=\"322\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/1/1ce67fdc5d6bb78102e6612ea6f36a19f2a7f107_2_322x500.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/1/1ce67fdc5d6bb78102e6612ea6f36a19f2a7f107_2_483x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/1/1ce67fdc5d6bb78102e6612ea6f36a19f2a7f107_2_644x1000.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/1/1ce67fdc5d6bb78102e6612ea6f36a19f2a7f107_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1131×1754 377 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div></p>",
