      "id": 254238,
      "name": "KateWalker",
      "username": "TakeWalker",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/{size}/5677_2.png",
      "created_at": "2023-09-26T16:31:30.732Z",
      "cooked": "<p>HIS NAME IS OLLIE??? XD I don’t know whether to laugh or cry!</p>\n<p>Few things do I love more than one of them says something dumb, obviously knows it’s dumb, and they’re both just really into it anyway. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/smiley.png?v=12\" title=\":smiley:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":smiley:\"></p>\n<p>Razor Racer? Yeah, Adam was right, that’s not as good a name as we came up with during his twitch stream. But it’s not awful! And it kind of sounds like something meant to counter Sk8blayd on his own turf.</p>\n<p>“Tell him I loved him!” “I won’t.” That is the best, over-the-top villainous comeback you could possibly ask for, oh my god. XD</p>\n<p>“‘Not again?’ What does he mean?!” He’s finally getting interesting and they’re about to kill him off!</p>\n<p>God, these two are the perfect people to tell this story. I am loving every word of this episode.</p>\n<p>Oh, I get it, Lazer Ryderz is the metaverse tribute to Sk8blayd’s own Bane. XD</p>\n<p>This was perfect, best issue ever, it was everything I could have asked for and more. Proof you can introduce a character just to kill him and have it be awesome. A truly radical death for a truly radical hero.</p>\n<p>And Trevor once again on point with the XTREEEEEM!!! sound effects. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/smiley.png?v=12\" title=\":smiley:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":smiley:\"></p>",
      "post_number": 2,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2023-09-26T16:31:30.732Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
