      "cooked": "<p>Wow, I’m getting so far behind…</p>\n<p>I have to say that this was one of the greatest games of “yes, and” that I’ve ever heard. Very entertaining, and they are right, it’s getting the whole arc with all the meta stuff that makes this cool!</p>\n<p>Just from the name alone, I…always pictured Sk8-Blayd as, like, a 12 year old. Whoops! Maybe that’s just the stage of life I was in when spelling with numbers like that was cool, and all we knew about him was the name. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/laughing.png?v=12\" title=\":laughing:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":laughing:\"></p>\n<p>I can’t be the only one who kept hearing “Ray’s Eraser,” can I? Every! Single! Time!</p>",
