      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/l/f4b2a3/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2026-02-05T18:01:33.621Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Razerracezor is a Lazer Ryder…</p>\n<p>There probably isn’t another episode that will bring this up, but I have to know: is that sword with two blades, which Sk8blayd has on this cover, the same one wielded by Extremiverse Hippocalypse?</p>\n<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Trajector\" data-post=\"7\" data-topic=\"30254\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/trajector/48/1914_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Trajector:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Just from the name alone, I…always pictured Sk8-Blayd as, like, a 12 year old.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>He’s exactly what Mister Sinister was originally supposed to be, a totally scary and seriously awesome “adult” as envisioned and created by a twelve year old.</p>",
